<title>UK: BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-EUROLEAGUE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of EuroLeague basketball matches on Thursday:</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>In Moscow:</p>
<p>Dynamo Moscow (Russia) 79 Sevilla (Spain) 75 (after extra time. score at full-time 65-65. halftime 36-32)  </p>
<p>Group A</p>
<p>In Istanbul:</p>
<p>Ulkerspor (Turkey) 99 Limoges (France) 91  (after extra time. score at full time 73-73)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Ulkerspor - Harun Erdenay 28, Orhun Ene 23</p>
<p>Limoges - Marc M'Bahia 18, Mike Doyle 15, Yann Bonato 15.</p>
<p>Group D</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen (Turkey) 78 Pau-Orthez (France) 76</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Efes Pilsen - Vasili Karasev 15, Petar Naumowski 26</p>
<p>Pau-Orthez - Corey Crowder 14, Laurent Foirest 11, Fabien Dubos 11.  </p>
<p>Group B</p>
<p>In Zagreb:</p>
<p>Cibona Zagreb (Croatia) 63 Olympiakos Athens (Greece) 61 (halftime 36-32)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Cibona - Davor Marcelic 19, Damir Mulaomerovic 12, Evgeny Kissourine 11</p>
<p>Olympiakos - Willy Anderson 12, Sigalas 12, Panayotis Fassoulas 11</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
<p>Group C</p>
<p>In Leverkusen:</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen (Germany) 71 Barcelona (Spain) 79 (30-40)  </p>
<p>Add Group A</p>
<p>In Tel Aviv</p>
<p>Maccabi Tel Aviv (Israel) 69 Panionios (Greece) 57 (39-28)</p>
<p>Leading scorers:</p>
<p>Maccabi Tel Aviv - Buck Johnson 16</p>
<p>Panionios - Keith Gatlin 10</p>
</text>
